        "original_id": "1c37486d-d57d-531c-afef-d4f83e7e56cb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lee Min-ho, Jun Ji-hyun, Hong Jin-kyung\n- Films: Gangnam Blues, Bounty Hunters\n- Television series: The Legend of the Blue Sea, My Love from the Star, Off to School\n- Places: Seoul, Gangnam district\n- Topics: South Korean media, China-produced films\n\nFacts:\n- My Love from the Star is a 2013 television series in which Hong Jin-kyung featured.\n- Off to School is a 2014 variety show in which Hong Jin-kyung starred.\n- In 2015, Lee Min-ho starred in his first leading film role with Gangnam Blues.\n- Gangnam Blues is set in the 1970s during the real estate development of Seoul's Gangnam district amid socio-political turmoil and terrorism.\n- Bounty Hunters is Lee Min-ho's first China-produced film, released in 2016.\n- The Legend of the Blue Sea is a 2016–2017 South Korean television series starring Jun Ji-hyun and Lee Min-ho.\n- Hong Jin-kyung featured in the 2016 television series The Legend of the Blue Sea.",
